                                "image_base64": ""
                            },
                            {
                                "id": "0,0,0,2",
                                "type": 4,
                                "level": 1,
                                "elements": ", then enter the axis bounds, the surface expressions and the variable names of the x and y axes. The surface expression can be anything within the accepted syntax. Variable names can be any names, but they must be different.",
